  "concept": {
    "zh": "两份工单 · 14 回合",
    "en": "Two work orders · 14 turns"
  },
  "brief": {
    "zh": "工单的 bay 指定西舱（west）或东舱（east）。在 14 回合内取走指定舱的两块电池，提交 codes 表里该舱的校验号，最终停在上方出口。移动和拾取各花 1 回合。同一程序还要通过另一份工单。",
    "en": "The work order’s bay is west or east. In 14 turns, take both batteries from that bay, submit its verification number from the codes table, and finish at the upper exit. A move or a pickup costs one turn. The same program must pass a second work order."
  },
